{"lines":[{"x":0.090100921946110149,"h":0.017128569190915099,"y":0.070650831654319624,"w":0.11867033640543619,"t":"Audioscripts","c":1},{"t":"TEST 2","y":0.11622665803499033,"c":1,"x":0.40601503688132073,"w":0.1033834584554037,"h":0.018995492594977459},{"h":0.017707662588538398,"t":"SECTION 1","y":0.18448164829082225,"w":0.15225564320882162,"c":1,"x":0.092105261305165775},{"y":0.21979485208683713,"h":0.010991690316971003,"w":0.031048154830932623,"c":1,"x":0.089739080024109602,"t":"JIM:"},{"y":0.23691860471275117,"c":1,"x":0.092105262941268889,"w":0.058270676930745446,"t":"WOMAN:","h":0.010174418447559619},{"t":"JIM:","y":0.25290697678359941,"w":0.028195489247639982,"h":0.010174418447559619,"x":0.092105262800992044,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.012025269399668748,"x":0.09203982540391803,"y":0.26869666750729093,"t":"WOMAN:","w":0.058401552836100268},{"t":"JIM:","w":0.031954886118570974,"c":1,"y":0.41860465103834466,"x":0.092105263613646848,"h":0.011627907148116789},{"y":0.46782809083497567,"w":0.058399276733398439,"c":1,"x":0.093920662284492737,"h":0.012018236895952383,"t":"WOMAN:"},{"t":"JIM:","x":0.093984962507653619,"w":0.030075187683105464,"y":0.5843023254311096,"h":0.011627907148116789,"c":1},{"h":0.011627907148116789,"y":0.6177325580344688,"t":"WOMAN:","c":1,"x":0.095864661437509491,"w":0.058270676930745446},{"w":0.028195489247639968,"h":0.011627907148116789,"t":"JIM:","x":0.095864661508698823,"c":1,"y":0.63372093000152296},{"t":"WOMAN:","c":1,"y":0.89952149285971628,"w":0.058394502003987631,"h":0.012003525870888709,"x":0.097682448155068352},{"x":0.16718788442846999,"w":0.24645212809244793,"h":0.018106149844177577,"c":1,"t":"Hello, South City Cycling Club.","y":0.2148180916598893},{"y":0.23082531845282317,"h":0.017856866869708443,"w":0.41181844075520829,"c":1,"x":0.16907994050652159,"t":"Oh, hi. Er ... I want to find out about joining the club."},{"c":1,"x":0.16900066397353045,"y":0.24465829823006802,"h":0.021834273378233404,"w":0.60560058593749999,"t":"Right. I can help you there. I'm the club secretary and my name's Jim Hunter."},{"h":0.015700759691188115,"x":0.16892436537404545,"c":1,"t":"Oh, hi Jim.","y":0.26613476783309586,"w":0.086769078572591113},{"x":0.16898206365410867,"w":0.3989329783121745,"c":1,"h":0.020383835452952415,"t":"So, are you interested in membership for yourself?","y":0.27932117007941781},{"t":"That's right.","x":0.16889902191053371,"y":0.29928376058735628,"h":0.014540543958439178,"c":1,"w":0.092663427988688124},{"x":0.16901802423619802,"y":0.31070776507307662,"t":"OK. Well there are basically two types of adult membership. If you're pretty serious","w":0.64884155273437494,"h":0.022043467642642312,"c":1},{"y":0.32735727111834212,"x":0.16899156823571274,"c":1,"t":"about cycling, there's the Full membership. That costs 260 dollars and that covers","w":0.64877665201822921,"h":0.022382209320952695},{"c":1,"x":0.16711420022860513,"y":0.3439609090580058,"t":"you not just for ordinary cycling but also for races both here in the city and also in","w":0.64314997355143233,"h":0.02120341873905851},{"w":0.18460049947102863,"t":"other parts of Australia.","h":0.016911104427025703,"c":1,"x":0.16892488152492813,"y":0.36456304033863463},{"w":0.65062662760416667,"t":"Right. Well, I'm not really up to that standard. I was more interested in just joining a","y":0.37727518347323041,"h":0.021116606742431543,"c":1,"x":0.17092512652474481},{"y":0.39644360771779574,"x":0.1690572406692227,"c":1,"t":"group to do some cycling in my free time.","w":0.32725140889485682,"h":0.017861815168254358},{"t":"Sure. That's why most people join. So, in that case you'd be better with the","w":0.58682195027669271,"h":0.02203825037477869,"c":1,"x":0.17088062467680809,"y":0.41018437712451328},{"y":0.42724859064207932,"x":0.1709163659372365,"t":"Recreational membership. That's 108 dollars if you're over 19, and 95 dollars if","h":0.020381619219463687,"c":1,"w":0.62058634440104166},{"w":0.10774674733479817,"x":0.16870718864634532,"y":0.44779115897291377,"t":"you're under.","h":0.016562818636528753,"c":1},{"t":"I'm 25","w":0.052631578445434563,"x":0.1691729328825459,"y":0.46511627912435327,"h":0.014600398228848621,"c":1},{"t":"OK. It's paid quarterly, and you can upgrade it later to the Full membership if","x":0.17088702863059912,"y":0.47665827445509712,"h":0.02133324617581156,"w":0.59998418172200518,"c":1},{"h":0.022076284355758036,"t":"you want to, of course. Now both types of membership include the club fee of 20","w":0.63571619669596346,"y":0.49257233025471681,"c":1,"x":0.16893449557751647},{"c":1,"w":0.65440760294596356,"y":0.51086775164684017,"t":"dollars. They also provide insurance in case you have an accident, though we hope","x":0.17091003417338149,"h":0.019118777568004064},{"h":0.017017721899539873,"y":0.52963452963037638,"c":1,"x":0.17076378540382403,"t":"you won't need that, of course.","w":0.24477139790852864},{"h":0.021806472513035469,"c":1,"y":0.54302175940707731,"t":"No. OK, well, I'll go with the Recreational membership, I think. And that allows me","x":0.17087759438438174,"w":0.64131169637044272},{"c":1,"y":0.56238915902382403,"x":0.16900528237909868,"t":"to join in the club activities, and so on?","h":0.018227709237790823,"w":0.30866315205891925},{"t":"That's right. And once you're a member of the club, you're also permitted to wear","x":0.17093543256468649,"y":0.5764987951018915,"c":1,"h":0.020610535444172351,"w":0.63750549316406258},{"c":1,"t":"our kit when you're out cycling. It's green and white.","x":0.17089067288932644,"y":0.59544646457151418,"w":0.40818433125813802,"h":0.018847291114939768},{"w":0.50037445068359376,"h":0.020824813105871254,"t":"Yes, I've seen cyclists wearing it. So, can I buy that at the club?","c":1,"y":0.61036430999698721,"x":0.17090014059782022},{"c":1,"h":0.021279589867330917,"t":"No, it's made to order by a company in Brisbane. You can find them online: they're","y":0.62596056252900145,"x":0.17276965014501361,"w":0.65062866210937509},{"c":1,"t":"called Jerriz. That's J-E-R-R-I-Z. You can use your membership number to put in an","w":0.65624404907226563,"h":0.020094259278051196,"y":0.64302340324114016,"x":0.1728097345928965},{"t":"order on their website.","x":0.17278584705418709,"w":0.17890430450439454,"y":0.66283967908985608,"h":0.01601995012488433,"c":1},{"h":0.02025794246007917,"t":"OK. Now, can you tell me a bit about the rides I can do?","c":1,"y":0.67721060001228051,"x":0.1727584089520369,"w":0.44026652018229173},{"x":0.17280607996351505,"c":1,"w":0.60933314005533856,"t":"Sure. So we have training rides pretty well every morning, and they're a really","y":0.69317492095386912,"h":0.022405021357981503},{"t":"good way of improving your cycling skills as well as your general level of fitness,","y":0.71012330150828651,"w":0.62993184407552083,"x":0.17278945762041295,"h":0.019933237541282178,"c":1},{"x":0.1727549359379833,"y":0.72499713609787353,"w":0.63947743733723961,"h":0.022650532621149133,"c":1,"t":"but they're different levels. Level A is pretty fast - you're looking at about 30 or 35"},{"w":0.63174260457356768,"h":0.017510549836364464,"t":"kilometres an hour. If you can do about 25 kilometres an hour, you'd probably be","y":0.74342884214189875,"x":0.17471537615814176,"c":1},{"x":0.17278013447509294,"y":0.75906042500562176,"w":0.6544137573242188,"t":"level B. and then level C are the novices, who stay at about 15 kilometres per hour.","h":0.020482692730787511,"c":1},{"t":"Right. Well I reckon I'd be level B. So, when are the sessions for that level?","x":0.17464926414199605,"h":0.021178931477602525,"w":0.59057683308919273,"y":0.77606603201765645,"c":1},{"y":0.79242639483661037,"h":0.0210905621609071,"c":1,"t":"There are a couple each week. They're both early morning sessions. There's one","x":0.17464371183552088,"w":0.637531483968099},{"y":0.80880401151412995,"w":0.62811579386393235,"h":0.02036093437356945,"t":"on Tuesdays, and for that one you meet at 5.30 am, and the meeting point's the","c":1,"x":0.17463896850156449},{"y":0.82836410949571071,"c":1,"t":"stadium - do you know where that is?","h":0.018832180320410674,"w":0.29936739603678386,"x":0.17457497231692864},{"t":"Yes, it's quite near my home, in fact. OK, and how about the other one?","h":0.021658578689683239,"w":0.56243586222330733,"x":0.17462718764474697,"y":0.84205165676811222,"c":1},{"y":0.85940628715673317,"x":0.17467073019782844,"w":0.63745666503906251,"c":1,"h":0.019904703458354933,"t":"That's on Thursdays. It starts at the same time, but they meet at the main gate to"},{"t":"Is that the one just past the shopping mall?","x":0.17460748699508788,"w":0.3406534576416016,"h":0.020294248405304249,"y":0.89378879746810824,"c":1},{"h":0.013081395234588844,"w":0.067669175465901704,"t":"That's it.","y":0.91424418608439839,"x":0.17481202871441756,"c":1},{"x":0.83430668041017819,"w":0.073786430358886768,"c":1,"y":0.24465737539579746,"t":"Example","h":0.015354930241493259}],"h":3106,"w":2400}